{"uid":"cli/commands/bof_registry.py::BofMarketplaceCommandSet.do_bsb_stage","name":"do_bsb_stage","qualname":"BofMarketplaceCommandSet.do_bsb_stage","kind":"method","file":"cli/commands/bof_registry.py","line":623,"end_line":653,"language":"py","signature":"def do_bsb_stage(self, line: str)","params":[{"name":"line","annotation":"str","default":"","kind":"positional"}],"returns":"","decorators":["cmd2.with_category(command_and_control_category)"],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Stage the fileless BlackSandBeacon and print its delivery one-liner.","description":"Usage: bsb_stage\n\nAligns the staged beacon runtime config with the LazyOwn C2\n(poll/report URIs, master key from sessions/key.aes), generates a\nstaging token on first use, and copies the fallback-chained\nfileless one-liner to the clipboard:\n\n    upstream /stage/ stager || raw /s/ memfd stager || disk curl\n\nPaste it on the target: it fetches the ELF + config over HTTPS,\nmemfd_creates both and execve's the beacon from anonymous memory\n(nothing is written to disk). Requires lhost/c2_port in\npayload.json and the C2 running.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"cli/commands/bof_registry.py::BofMarketplaceCommandSet","members":[],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":false,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":["core/console.py::print_error","core/console.py::print_msg","core/console.py::print_succ","utils.py::copy2clip"],"called_by":[]}
